sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Publishing team
    participant R as Runtime
    participant S as Durable store
    participant B as Receiving team
    A->>R: Propose bundle and exact artifacts
    R->>R: Check grants, decisions and schemas
    R->>S: Publish immutable payloads
    R->>S: Commit manifest, envelope and outbox
    R->>R: Validate target baseline and deduplicate
    alt Valid delivery
        R->>S: Append receipt and inbox entry
        R->>B: Materialize exact granted inputs
        B->>R: Propose own bounded task plan
    else Invalid or stale delivery
        R->>S: Append rejection or stale receipt
        R-->>A: Findings through scoped runtime view
    end
